!! **Savannah is well below target at 93.6%.** Dallas, at 96.5%, is also under the 97.0% target and worth watching.

## Needs attention

!! **Savannah crane outage.** The container crane was out of service from 2026-10-12 to 2026-10-15, leaving a backlog of 1,150 orders. With approved overtime, the backlog should be cleared by 2026-10-19.

